    {
      "description_en": "The time-to-live (TTL) of the backup. The time must be in the *yyyy-MM-dd*T*HH:mm:ss*Z format and in UTC.\n\n> - *9999-01-01*T*00:00:00*&#x5A;*&#x20;indicates that the backup is retained permanently.*\n>\n>   *- You can only extend the retention period. You cannot shorten it.- If you do not set the time to *9999-01-01*T*00:00:00*Z, the new expiration time must be within 730 days after the end time of the backup set.*\n>\n> **",
      "description_zh": "备份过期时间，格式为 <i>yyyy-MM-dd</i>T<i>HH:mm:ss</i>Z（UTC时间）。\n\n\n>-  <i>9999-01-01</i>T<i>00:00:00</i>Z<i> 表示长久保留。\n>- 只能延长备份保留时间，不可缩短。\n>- 当设置的时间不是 <i>9999-01-01</i>T<i>00:00:00</i>Z 时，必须在备份集结束时间之后的 730 天范围内。",
      "example": "2025-03-29T03:47:12Z",
      "help_en": "The time-to-live (TTL) of the backup. The time must be in the *yyyy-MM-dd*T*HH:mm:ss*Z format and in UTC.\n\n> - *9999-01-01*T*00:00:00*&#x5A;*&#x20;indicates that the backup is retained permanently.*\n>\n>   *- You can only extend the retention period. You cannot shorten it.- If you do not set the time to *9999-01-01*T*00:00:00*Z, the new expiration time must be within 730 days after the end time of the backup set.*\n>\n> **",
      "help_zh": "备份过期时间，格式为 <i>yyyy-MM-dd</i>T<i>HH:mm:ss</i>Z（UTC时间）。\n\n\n>-  <i>9999-01-01</i>T<i>00:00:00</i>Z<i> 表示长久保留。\n>- 只能延长备份保留时间，不可缩短。\n>- 当设置的时间不是 <i>9999-01-01</i>T<i>00:00:00</i>Z 时，必须在备份集结束时间之后的 730 天范围内",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "backup_expire_time",
